{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1186","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Vus the Cossack and Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vus the Cossack has two binary strings, that is, strings that consist only of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". We call these strings $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. It is known that $$$|b| \\leq |a|$$$, that is, the length of $$$b$$$ is at most the length of $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Cossack considers every substring of length $$$|b|$$$ in string $$$a$$$. Let's call this substring $$$c$$$. He matches the corresponding characters in $$$b$$$ and $$$c$$$, after which he counts the number of positions where the two strings are different. We call this function $$$f(b, c)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, let $$$b = 00110$$$, and $$$c = 11000$$$. In these strings, the first, second, third and fourth positions are different."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vus the Cossack counts the number of such substrings $$$c$$$ such that $$$f(b, c)$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"even"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, let $$$a = 01100010$$$ and $$$b = 00110$$$. $$$a$$$ has four substrings of the length $$$|b|$$$: $$$01100$$$, $$$11000$$$, $$$10001$$$, $$$00010$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(00110, 01100) = 2$$$;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(00110, 11000) = 4$$$;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(00110, 10001) = 4$$$;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(00110, 00010) = 1$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since in three substrings, $$$f(b, c)$$$ is even, the answer is $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vus can not find the answer for big strings. That is why he is asking you to help him."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a binary string $$$a$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |a| \\leq 10^6$$$) — the first string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a binary string $$$b$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |b| \\leq |a|$$$) — the second string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one number — the answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n01100010\n00110\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1010111110\n0110\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first example is explained in the legend."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are five substrings that satisfy us: $$$1010$$$, $$$0101$$$, $$$1111$$$, $$$1111$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1186C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1186/problem/C"}